      "text": "Fig. 17, ‘Age distribution of (a) medical doctors and (b) nursing personnel, by income group’ (Source: WHO National Health Workforce Accounts, 2025, latest available data for 122 countries for medical doctors and 142 countries for nursing personnel over 2015–2024). Two grouped horizontal bar charts showing the percentage of the workforce in six age brackets (<25, 25–34, 35–44, 45–54, 55–64, and 65+) across Low-income, Lower-middle-income, Upper-middle-income, and High-income countries for (a) medical doctors (0.0% to 50.0% scale) and (b) nursing personnel (0.0% to 50.0% scale).",
